-- title:
--   Trace weights and Schatten norms
-- statement:
--   For a square operator $C$ and a real $p$, define
--   $$
--   w_p(C)=\operatorname{Re}\operatorname{Tr}[(C^*C)^{p/2}],\qquad \|C\|_p=w_p(C)^{1/p}.
--   $$
--   Powers are taken by continuous functional calculus, and the real-power expression uses Lean's totalized convention. In the positive-exponent ranges used by the proof these are the usual finite-dimensional Schatten weight and norm. The interface is used by trace duality and weighted interpolation arguments; applicable exponent hypotheses belong to their theorem statements.
